IMPORT policy

§ `Q1 - burns suffered while doing duty as a fire fighter`

q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `age at hospitalization`                            IS 40
    `months after effective date of hospitalization`    IS 3
    sickness                                            IS FALSE
    `accidental injury`                                 IS TRUE
    `arose from skydiving`                              IS FALSE
    `arose from service in the military`                IS FALSE
    `arose from service as a fire fighter`              IS TRUE
    `arose from service in the police`                  IS FALSE
    `fraud misrepresentation or withholding`            IS FALSE
    `wellness visit months after effective date`        IS JUST 1
    `wellness confirmation months after effective date` IS JUST 2

#EVAL `covered` q1

